Reconstruction: pack content is synthesized orientation notes from RG 1.174
Rev. 3 pinned facts (P9 listing-page pin, 2026-11-08) and carried B-01 50.59
facts. RG verbatim excerpts are capped at two sentences by licence policy;
this pack contains zero quotations. RG 1.200 Rev 3 and NUREG-1855 are named
only, with revision and owner, and their text is never reproduced here. The
guide's numeric guideline tables live in the guide and are not reproduced
here.

